SCOPE
-----
The license below (the MIT License) applies ONLY to the original RG OS
source material in this repository, namely:

  - rgos/                  launcher, input hub, Wi-Fi/Bluetooth/SSH/update tooling
  - initramfs/             RG OS initramfs and boot patch scripts
  - tools/                 update packaging tools
  - build.sh, inspect-kernel.sh, .github/workflows/
  - config/                RetroArch and gamepad configuration
  - audio/, docs/, README.md
  - splash/                RG OS startup animation and sound
  - spl-flasher/*.sh, spl-flasher/*.bat, spl-flasher/README.txt

It does NOT apply to anything listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. That
includes the software RG OS downloads, installs or compiles when it
builds an image (Debian packages, the ROCKNIX kernel/firmware/bootloader,
RetroArch and the libretro cores), and the third-party files stored in
this repository (spl-flasher/ binaries and images, music/). Each of those
remains under its own license, which takes precedence for that component.

A built RG OS image is a collection of separate programs. It is not a
single work, and the MIT License above does not relicense any of them.
Redistributing an image means you must also comply with the licenses in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, including the source-code obligations of the GPL
and LGPL components.


